ogram should: Generate a thumbnail version (e.g., very small) of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) Display the thumbnail to the user (using the Linux command-line display program) Ask the user whether or not it should be rotated; if so, do it. (using the Linux command-line convert program) Ask the user for a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":190610,"global_rank":338845},{"name":"hmorzaria/Atlantis_tuning","owner":"hmorzaria","html_url":"https://github.com/hmorzaria/Atlantis_tuning","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"Plot code for Atlantis tuning","topics":[],"score":190602,"global_rank":338851},{"name":"lowellbander/ethics","owner":"lowellbander","html_url":"https://github.com/lowellbander/ethics","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"TeX","description":null,"topics":[],"score":190602,"global_rank":338858},{"name":"lindison/minecraft","owner":"lindison","html_url":"https://github.com/lindison/minecraft","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":190602,"global_rank":338859},{"name":"MrArnoldPalmer/reagent-music","owner":"MrArnoldPalmer","html_url":"https://github.com/MrArnoldPalmer/reagent-music","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"Clojurescript fun with reagent","topics":[],"score":190602,"global_rank":338862},{"name":"pinkwerks/emacs","owner":"pinkwerks","html_url":"https://github.com